  "version": "1.36",
  "codename": "Haru",
  "description": "Inspired by Hokusai's 'Thirty-six Views of Mount Fuji', Kubernetes 1.36 'Haru' brings 70 enhancements. User namespaces and MutatingAdmissionPolicy graduate to GA for stronger security defaults, fine-grained kubelet API authorization reaches GA for least-privilege RBAC, and SELinux volume labeling goes GA for constant-time mounts. Memory QoS arrives in alpha with tiered cgroup v2 protection across QoS classes.",
